        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Green lace-patterned silk damask brocaded with silver metallic file and frise threads. Luxuriant design with central stylized floral and foliate sprays in silver metallic thread with outlines and details in oink, salmon, yellow, and green silk against figured green damask ground and enclosed in scrolled cartouches; borders densely patterned with silver and silk florals and foliage."@en ;
